## 7-PHASE WORKFLOW

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> P0: Start
    P0 --> P1: Inventory complete
    P1 --> P2: Flows documented
    P2 --> P3: Mappings & Signatures documented
    P3 --> P4: Contracts & Hierarchy documented
    P4 --> P5: Security & Supporting documented
    P5 --> P6: Cross-artifact synthesis complete
    P6 --> [*]: Zero data loss certified
```

| Phase | Name | Scope | Deliverable |
|-------|------|-------|-------------|
| **0** | Discovery & Planning | Scan project folder(s), classify all artifacts, count elements, build reading plan | Sections 1-2, component-inventory.md |
| **1** | Flow Documentation | Per-FLOW RGV: steps, components, pipeline effects, invocations | Section 3, flow-configuration.md |
| **2** | Mapping & Signature Docs | Per-NDF RGV: service signatures, field mappings, adapter/backend details | Section 4, mapping-tables.md, service-signatures.md |
| **3** | Profile & Contract Docs | Per-WSDL/XSD/DocType RGV: schema contracts, IDF hierarchy | Section 5, contract-schemas.md |
| **4** | Security & Supporting Docs | Per-ACL + JAVA + config/policy artifacts | Section 6, security-summary.md |
| **5** | Cross-Artifact Synthesis | End-to-end call chain, consolidated contracts, mapping summary, functional summary | Section 7 in main doc |
| **6** | Validation & Certification | File-by-file reconciliation, gap analysis, zero data loss certification | Section 8, verification-checklist.md |

**Processing:** Continuous with micro-checkpoints per section (no user stops between phases).

